// The dash's own GATT server, up only while it sends its data log to a
// phone (Send log, in the settings): the phone writes 'S' to the control
// characteristic and gets the log as notifications of the data one.
PRIMARY_SERVICE, GAP_SERVICE
CHARACTERISTIC, GAP_DEVICE_NAME, READ, "GT86 DASH"

PRIMARY_SERVICE, c0ff8600-4b1e-4c7a-9e2d-5a3f86d0a001
CHARACTERISTIC, c0ff8601-4b1e-4c7a-9e2d-5a3f86d0a001, WRITE | WRITE_WITHOUT_RESPONSE | DYNAMIC,
CHARACTERISTIC, c0ff8602-4b1e-4c7a-9e2d-5a3f86d0a001, NOTIFY,
